    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2262990/extras/c95faae13cc1ad1c9b821843f0d913ae.poster.avif?t=1690504351\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2262990/extras/c95faae13cc1ad1c9b821843f0d913ae.webm?t=1690504351\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2262990/extras/c95faae13cc1ad1c9b821843f0d913ae.mp4?t=1690504351\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >OVERVIEW</h2>Hack and slash through hordes of beasts and powerful boss enemies as a sexy costume clad caf\u00e9 manager on a mission to save her kidnapped employee!<br>Use up to <strong>three weapons at once</strong> to attack, guard, and combo to wipe out large groups of enemies, or deal massive damage to bosses with this simple to pick up yet satisfying combat system. <br>Collect new weapons, power ups, and costumes as you progress, then put your skills to test in 1v1 battles against side-characters in the unlockable arena mode!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STORY</h2>In a fantasy world where humans and mythical creatures live tenuously side-by-side, a busty, weapon-savvy cafe manager springs into action when one of her employees is kidnapped by a gang of goblins. Can she safely fight her way through the lawless land of wild beats, orcs, and dragons to rescue her star waitress?<br>Or will she herself fall into the hands of evil as well...?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ARENA MODE</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2262990/extras/beed91816f3a4ab113876fb15e5c0844.poster.avif?t=1690504351\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2262990/extras/beed91816f3a4ab113876fb15e5c0844.webm?t=1690504351\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2262990/extras/beed91816f3a4ab113876fb15e5c0844.mp4?t=1690504351\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Clear the game once to unlock area mode! Select your fighter, choose their outfit, then begin fighting your way through increasingly difficult one-on-one matches, and 4 way multi-character brawls! <br>Each fighter has their own unique special ability and basic weapons, so have fun learning the unique attacks, strengths, and weaknesses of them all!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2262990/extras/f6bb5ff36d015c2bedafb9b56e857cc5.poster.avif?t=1690504351\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2262990/extras/f6bb5ff36d015c2bedafb9b56e857cc5.webm?t=1690504351\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2262990/extras/f6bb5ff36d015c2bedafb9b56e857cc5.mp4?t=1690504351\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>9 weapons to find and collect including a bastard sword, axe, spear, machine gun, grenade launcher and more!<br></li><li>3 costumes: Maid clothes, athletic wear, or bunny girl outfit.<br></li><li>Wide variety of enemies including dragon dogs, goblins, orcs, Minotaur, spiders, worms, frogs, bees, land dragons, and more.<br></li><li>Unlockable Arena Mode with 6 different characters and progressively harder 1v1 and free for all matches.<br></li><li>Adjustable difficulty which when set to higher than normal gives enemies the ability to learn and counter your play-style.<br></li><li>Editable key mapping and controller support for a customized game experience .</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2262990/extras/c95faae13cc1ad1c9b821843f0d913ae.poster.avif?t=1690504351\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2262990/extras/c95faae13cc1ad1c9b821843f0d913ae.webm?t=1690504351\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2262990/extras/c95faae13cc1ad1c9b821843f0d913ae.mp4?t=1690504351\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >OVERVIEW</h2>Hack and slash through hordes of beasts and powerful boss enemies as a sexy costume clad caf\u00e9 manager on a mission to save her kidnapped employee!<br>Use up to <strong>three weapons at once</strong> to attack, guard, and combo to wipe out large groups of enemies, or deal massive damage to bosses with this simple to pick up yet satisfying combat system. <br>Collect new weapons, power ups, and costumes as you progress, then put your skills to test in 1v1 battles against side-characters in the unlockable arena mode!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STORY</h2>In a fantasy world where humans and mythical creatures live tenuously side-by-side, a busty, weapon-savvy cafe manager springs into action when one of her employees is kidnapped by a gang of goblins. Can she safely fight her way through the lawless land of wild beats, orcs, and dragons to rescue her star waitress?<br>Or will she herself fall into the hands of evil as well...?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ARENA MODE</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2262990/extras/beed91816f3a4ab113876fb15e5c0844.poster.avif?t=1690504351\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2262990/extras/beed91816f3a4ab113876fb15e5c0844.webm?t=1690504351\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2262990/extras/beed91816f3a4ab113876fb15e5c0844.mp4?t=1690504351\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Clear the game once to unlock area mode! Select your fighter, choose their outfit, then begin fighting your way through increasingly difficult one-on-one matches, and 4 way multi-character brawls! <br>Each fighter has their own unique special ability and basic weapons, so have fun learning the unique attacks, strengths, and weaknesses of them all!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2262990/extras/f6bb5ff36d015c2bedafb9b56e857cc5.poster.avif?t=1690504351\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2262990/extras/f6bb5ff36d015c2bedafb9b56e857cc5.webm?t=1690504351\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2262990/extras/f6bb5ff36d015c2bedafb9b56e857cc5.mp4?t=1690504351\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>9 weapons to find and collect including a bastard sword, axe, spear, machine gun, grenade launcher and more!<br></li><li>3 costumes: Maid clothes, athletic wear, or bunny girl outfit.<br></li><li>Wide variety of enemies including dragon dogs, goblins, orcs, Minotaur, spiders, worms, frogs, bees, land dragons, and more.<br></li><li>Unlockable Arena Mode with 6 different characters and progressively harder 1v1 and free for all matches.<br></li><li>Adjustable difficulty which when set to higher than normal gives enemies the ability to learn and counter your play-style.<br></li><li>Editable key mapping and controller support for a customized game experience .</li></ul>",
